//! std::process — deprecated compatibility facade over `std::host::process`.
//!
//! ADR-046 moved process control to the `Process` namespace; the legacy free
//! `exit` / `abort` wrappers were deleted in the #917 host/core wave. Importing
//! this module still emits the "module `std::process` has moved to
//! `std::host::process`" warning, and a qualified old free call fails with an
//! E0100 hint that names the `Process` replacement. New code should import
//! `use std::host::process::Process` and call `Process::exit` /
//! `Process::abort`.
pub use std::host::process::Process
